flowchart LR
    subgraph SOURCES[來源]
        GUIDEBOOK[客戶指南手冊]
        PUBLIC_EVIDENCE[已驗證的公開證據]
        CATALOGUE[以機構為範圍的 The Ground 活動目錄]
        VISITOR_FORM[訪客意向表格]
    end

    subgraph PRODUCT_RUNTIME[產品與執行環境]
        EVIDENCE_REGISTER[證據登錄冊]
        TYPED_CONTENT[雙語型別化內容]
        BILINGUAL_INTERFACE[品牌與指南手冊介面]
        EVENT_ADAPTER[僅限伺服器端的活動轉接器]
        PROGRAMME_INTERFACE[首頁與節目介面]
        WEBSITE_API[已驗證的網站 API]
        QUEUE[Cloudflare 佇列]
        OPENNEXT[OpenNext Worker 執行環境]
        R2_CACHE[R2 增量快取<br/>絕不儲存潛在客戶提交資料]
        REVALIDATION[Durable Object 重新驗證協調]
    end

    subgraph DESTINATIONS[目的地]
        BOOKING[標準 The Ground 報名頁面]
        PRIVATE_CONSUMER[私有消費者 Worker]
        GOOGLE_SHEET[客戶擁有的 Google 試算表]
    end

    GUIDEBOOK --> EVIDENCE_REGISTER
    PUBLIC_EVIDENCE --> EVIDENCE_REGISTER
    EVIDENCE_REGISTER --> TYPED_CONTENT
    TYPED_CONTENT --> BILINGUAL_INTERFACE

    CATALOGUE --> EVENT_ADAPTER
    EVENT_ADAPTER --> PROGRAMME_INTERFACE
    PROGRAMME_INTERFACE --> BOOKING

    VISITOR_FORM --> WEBSITE_API
    WEBSITE_API -->|僅限真實且未觸發 honeypot 的提交| QUEUE
    QUEUE --> PRIVATE_CONSUMER
    PRIVATE_CONSUMER --> GOOGLE_SHEET

    BILINGUAL_INTERFACE -.->|由此提供服務| OPENNEXT
    PROGRAMME_INTERFACE -.->|由此提供服務| OPENNEXT
    WEBSITE_API -.->|由此處理| OPENNEXT
    OPENNEXT -.->|僅限增量快取| R2_CACHE
    OPENNEXT -.->|協調重新驗證| REVALIDATION

    classDef evidence fill:#eaf4e1,stroke:#48633c,color:#20301b
    classDef programme fill:#e4f1f7,stroke:#356a7d,color:#16333d
    classDef submission fill:#f7eadf,stroke:#8a5834,color:#442a18
    classDef runtime fill:#f0eef5,stroke:#675b79,color:#312a3a
    class GUIDEBOOK,PUBLIC_EVIDENCE,EVIDENCE_REGISTER,TYPED_CONTENT,BILINGUAL_INTERFACE evidence
    class CATALOGUE,EVENT_ADAPTER,PROGRAMME_INTERFACE,BOOKING programme
    class VISITOR_FORM,WEBSITE_API,QUEUE,PRIVATE_CONSUMER,GOOGLE_SHEET submission
    class OPENNEXT,R2_CACHE,REVALIDATION runtime
